              highlighted: ["AB","C"] },
            { text: "so that {AC} and {CB} are medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a medial rectangle.",
              visible: SET,
              highlighted: ["AC","CB"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "AB second bimedial", ref: "X.38" }] },
            { text: "It is then manifest that {C} is not at the point of bisection,",
              visible: SET,
              highlighted: ["C"] },
            { text: "because the segments are not commensurable in length.",
              visible: SET,
